notes: |
  AprilTag textures for the mavis_v2_kitchen digital twin (03-sim §4.4):
  the four tags on the lab kitchen's fridge (ids 0, 4 on the +X side panel, 1
  on the upper door) and range (id 3 on the oven door), measured 2026-09-09.
  Each file is the upstream 9x9-bit master (tag41_12_0000N.png) scaled 64x
  nearest-neighbour with ONE white bit of margin all round -> 11 bits = 704 px,
  8-bit grayscale. On a plate of 0.205 m (sheet with margin) a bit is 18.6 mm
  and the detected quad (the inner 5 bits of this family) 0.0931 m, matching
  the real sheets. Used as MuJoCo 2D file textures (builder.py, texuniform
  false); the renderer maps the whole texture onto each box face.
